{
  "$Comment": [
    "How the Headless Horseman flies in the saddle, phase 1 of his fight. Both mounted roles",
    "(Hallows_Eve_Headless_Horseman_Mounted and _Mounted_HM) name this file in",
    "CombatAdditionalBehaviorComponent, the hook Template_Flying_Aggressive runs ahead of its own",
    "combat moves on every tick he is fighting. It only ever picks where he flies and lets the",
    "template go on after it, so the template keeps aiming and throwing his lantern bombs the whole",
    "time.",
    "",
    "He loops through three moves. Dive: he flies straight back at his target and down into his",
    "role's MotionDesiredAltitudeCombat band (1 to 3 blocks up), until he is within DiveReach of",
    "the player or DiveTimeLimit runs out. Engage: for EngageTime he fights low with the template's",
    "own chase, where a sword reaches him. Swing: he breaks off for SwingTime, flying at full speed",
    "between random points 7 to 9 blocks up on an oval round the graveyard's fountain, about 12",
    "blocks out along the road and 9 across it, so every leg stays inside the road's barrier walls",
    "and above the fountain's brazier, then dives again.",
    "",
    "One to three of his break-offs are laps of the fountain instead (Lap_1 to Lap_8 below, eight",
    "points 7 blocks from its centre and 7 blocks up, round in order for LapTime, about one or two",
    "laps), and he keeps throwing bombs while he laps. His first break-off once FirstLapAfter has",
    "passed since he started fighting is always a lap, so every ride sees one. After it, each time",
    "LapGap passes, his next break-off may be a second and then a third lap, each an even chance",
    "(ExtraLapWeight against ExtraSwingWeight), and never more than three in the ride.",
    "",
    "Every point is an Offset from where he spawned (his leash point, read through the Leash",
    "sensor), and his spawn marker stands on the plaza's north side, 7 blocks north of the fountain's",
    "centre (tools/arenas/Hallows_Eve_Graveyard.json and _Hard.json). Move that marker and these",
    "offsets move with it, so change them together. Offsets read X east, Y up from the floor, Z",
    "south. The timers, flags and the Lap_Point slot are this file's own names. Raised beside his",
    "fight's script away from the graveyard, he loops the same shapes around that spot."
  ],
  "Type": "Component",
  "Class": "Instruction",
  "Interface": "Hytale.Instruction.Combat",
  "DefaultState": ".Dive",
  "Parameters": {
    "DiveReach": {
      "Value": 4,
      "Description": "How close to his target a dive must bring him before he fights low."
    },
    "DiveTimeLimit": {
      "Value": [ 4, 4 ],
      "Description": "Seconds a dive may take before he fights low wherever he is."
    },
    "DiveSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed on a dive, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "EngageTime": {
      "Value": [ 6, 9 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he fights low over his target after each dive before he breaks off."
    },
    "SwingTime": {
      "Value": [ 4, 6 ],
      "Description": "Seconds each high swing lasts before he dives back."
    },
    "SwingLegTime": {
      "Value": [ 1.5, 2.5 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he flies toward one random point of the swing oval before picking another."
    },
    "SwingSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed on a swing, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "LapTime": {
      "Value": [ 5, 10 ],
      "Description": "Seconds a fountain lap lasts; at full speed one lap takes about 5."
    },
    "LapSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed around the fountain, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "LapPointReach": {
      "Value": 3,
      "Description": "How close he must come to one lap point before he turns for the next."
    },
    "FirstLapAfter": {
      "Value": [ 20, 20 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after he starts fighting before a break-off becomes his first fountain lap, which always comes."
    },
    "LapGap": {
      "Value": [ 15, 25 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after one lap's turn before the next break-off rolls for another lap."
    },
    "ExtraLapWeight": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "The odds of the second and third laps: this weight against ExtraSwingWeight."
    },
    "ExtraSwingWeight": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "The odds that a second or third lap is a plain swing instead."
    }
  },
  "Content": {
    "Continue": true,
    "Instructions": [
      {
        "$Comment": "Once, the first time he fights: his opening dive gets its DiveTimeLimit, and the clock to his first fountain lap starts.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "Flag",
          "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ride_Started",
          "Set": false
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ride_Started"
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive",
            "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" },
            "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" }
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait",
            "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "FirstLapAfter" },
            "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapGap" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Dive: straight back at his target and down into sword reach.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Dive"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "$Comment": "In reach, or the dive took too long: fight low for EngageTime.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "Or",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Target",
                  "Range": { "Compute": "DiveReach" }
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "EngageTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "EngageTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "State",
                "State": ".Engage"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "DesiredAltitudeWeight 1 holds him to the role's MotionDesiredAltitudeCombat band as he closes.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "Target"
            },
            "BodyMotion": {
              "Type": "Seek",
              "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 1,
              "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "DiveSpeed" },
              "SlowDownDistance": 5,
              "StopDistance": 2.5
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Engage: no move of his own here, so the template's chase holds him low over his target. When EngageTime runs out he breaks off: a fountain lap when one is due, else a swing.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Engage"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "$Comment": "His first lap, always, at the first break-off once FirstLapAfter has passed.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_1",
                  "Set": false
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "SetFlag",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_1"
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapGap" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapGap" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "State",
                "State": ".Lap_1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "The roll for a second lap, at the first break-off once LapGap has passed since the first: an even chance of a lap, else a swing.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_1"
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_2",
                  "Set": false
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "SetFlag",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_2"
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapGap" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapGap" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Random",
                "Actions": [
                  {
                    "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraLapWeight" },
                    "Action": {
                      "Type": "State",
                      "State": ".Lap_1"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraSwingWeight" },
                    "Action": {
                      "Type": "State",
                      "State": ".Swing"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "The roll for a third and last lap, LapGap after the second roll, the same even chance.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_2"
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_3",
                  "Set": false
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait",
                  "State": "Stopped"
                }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "SetFlag",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_3"
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Random",
                "Actions": [
                  {
                    "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraLapWeight" },
                    "Action": {
                      "Type": "State",
                      "State": ".Lap_1"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraSwingWeight" },
                    "Action": {
                      "Type": "State",
                      "State": ".Swing"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "Otherwise a swing.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "Timer",
              "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage",
              "State": "Stopped"
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "State",
                "State": ".Swing"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Swing: high and fast between random points on an oval round the fountain's centre (about 12 blocks out along the road, 9 across it, 7 to 9 blocks up), then dive.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Swing"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "Timer",
              "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing",
              "State": "Stopped"
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive",
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "State",
                "State": ".Dive"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "Every SwingLegTime a fresh random point. DesiredAltitudeWeight 0 lets the point's own height win over his low combat band.",
            "Type": "Random",
            "ExecuteFor": { "Compute": "SwingLegTime" },
            "Instructions": [
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ 0, 8, -5 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
                  "SlowDownDistance": 2,
                  "StopDistance": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ 8.5, 7, -1.5 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
                  "SlowDownDistance": 2,
                  "StopDistance": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ 9, 9, 7 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
                  "SlowDownDistance": 2,
                  "StopDistance": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ 8.5, 7, 15.5 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
                  "SlowDownDistance": 2,
                  "StopDistance": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ 0, 8, 19 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
                  "SlowDownDistance": 2,
                  "StopDistance": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ -8.5, 7, 15.5 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
                  "SlowDownDistance": 2,
                  "StopDistance": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "AdjustPosition",
                  "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 },
                  "Offset": [ -9, 9, 7 ]
                },
                "BodyMotion": {
                  "Type": "Seek",
                  "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
                  "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" },
